{"In desktop/topic-post.scss, .embedded-posts .topic-meta-data h5 a uses dark-light-choose with inverted 30%/70% mapping compared to the established pattern used elsewhere for link-like text, making embedded-post metadata links inconsistent with common/base link styling": 0.40238726139068604, "In mobile/modal.scss, .custom-message-length uses dark-light-choose with swapped arguments, applying wrong values in both light and dark themes because dark-light-choose returns its first argument in light themes, creating inconsistency with desktop/modal.scss": 0.9299979209899902, "In mobile/topic-post.scss, .topic-map h3 was changed to the same 50%/50% dark-light-choose mapping as .topic-map h4, eliminating visual distinction between heading levels and diverging from desktop which retains distinct h3 (20%/80%) vs h4 (50%/50%)": 0.48606181144714355}